## How to Use

When the user asks to use a skill (e.g., "use cb.review-main" or "fix CI using pr.check-ci"):

1. Read the full skill file from `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`
2. Follow the instructions in the skill file
3. Announce the skill being used as specified in the skill file
